{"kp_id": "zj-032.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-032", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "小海为小肠合穴、子穴，浅刺一寸即可；小肠实症可取。肩痛久治不效时须查是否未取本经穴如小海。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.si8", "meridian.si"], "chapter_id": "zj-032.c01", "evidence_quote": "小肠君的实症通通才可以在这里治疗", "seg_from": 34, "seg_to": 75, "start_s": 180.28, "end_s": 399.93, "citation": {"youtube_id": "lDF3EoW9XA4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lDF3EoW9XA4&t=180s", "series": "zj", "episode": 32, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 32", "start_s": 180.28, "end_s": 399.93}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "子血=子穴；小孩/小海鲜=小海", "source": "llm_read"}
